=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ FINDUTILS @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt GNU findutils @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt GNU findutils is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later; see COPYING.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [FINDUTILS.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for GNU findutils
    At system startup: to define FINDUTILS$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:FINDUTILS$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the commands, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @FINDUTILS$ROOT:[000000]FINDUTILS$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE FINDUTILS removes the product and deassigns FINDUTILS$ROOT.
